  planner_response {
    response: "Ch\303\240o b\341\272\241n, t\303\264i \304\221\303\243 nh\341\272\255n to\303\240n b\341\273\231 b\341\272\243n \304\221\341\272\267c t\341\272\243 y\303\252u c\341\272\247u v\303\240 n\341\272\257m r\303\265 **Nguy\303\252n t\341\272\257c l\303\240m vi\341\273\207c quan tr\341\273\215ng nh\341\272\245t: TUY\341\273\206T \304\220\341\273\220I KH\303\224NG T\341\273\260 \303\235 QUY\341\272\276T \304\220\341\273\212NH** v\341\273\201 architecture, tech stack, data model, API design, hay b\341\272\245t k\341\273\263 behavior n\303\240o khi ch\306\260a c\303\263 s\341\273\261 x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n.\n\nTu\303\242n th\341\273\247 \304\221\303\272ng quy tr\303\254nh, t\303\264i **ch\306\260a vi\341\272\277t b\341\272\245t k\341\273\263 d\303\262ng code nghi\341\273\207p v\341\273\245 n\303\240o** v\303\240 b\341\272\257t \304\221\341\272\247u ngay b\341\272\261ng **Phase 1 \342\200\224 Requirement Confirmation**.\n\n---\n\n# PHASE 1 \342\200\224 REQUIREMENT CONFIRMATION\n\n## 1. Danh s\303\241ch y\303\252u c\341\272\247u \304\221\303\243 x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n (CONFIRMED)\n\n1. **Ph\341\272\241m vi h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng**:\n   - \304\220i\341\273\201u khi\341\273\203n **1 AMR duy nh\341\272\245t**.\n   - C\303\263 2 Line/Cycle: **Line A** v\303\240 **Line B**.\n   - M\341\273\227i Line c\303\263 2 station: **Pickup** v\303\240 **Dropoff** (T\341\273\225ng c\341\273\231ng 4 station: A1, A2, B1, B2).\n   - Thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213: PDA Android m\303\240n h\303\254nh nh\341\273\217, truy c\341\272\255p qua Android Browser.\n\n2. **\304\220\341\273\213nh tuy\341\272\277n URL c\341\273\247a 4 Station**:\n   - `/control/line-a/pickup`\n   - `/control/line-a/dropoff`\n   - `/control/line-b/pickup`\n   - `/control/line-b/dropoff`\n   - URL ch\341\273\211 d\303\271ng \304\221\341\273\203 x\303\241c \304\221\341\273\213nh `line` v\303\240 `station`. Frontend kh\303\264ng hardcode d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u nghi\341\273\207p v\341\273\245.\n\n3. **C\341\272\245u h\303\254nh Order & Trigger**:\n   - Hai station trong c\303\271ng m\341\273\231t Line d\303\271ng chung 1 L\341\273\207nh g\341\273\215i AMR (A1 & A2 d\303\271ng chung **L\341\273\207nh A**; B1 & B2 d\303\271ng chung **L\341\273\207nh B**).\n   - L\341\273\207nh A v\303\240 L\341\273\207nh B ch\341\273\211 kh\303\241c nhau \341\273\237 `orderId` v\303\240 `taskPath`.\n   - M\341\273\227i station c\303\263 m\341\273\231t \304\221i\341\273\203m Trigger ri\303\252ng bi\341\273\207t (`currentStation`).\n   - Frontend \304\221\341\273\215c `line` v\303\240 `station` t\341\273\253 URL, sau \304\221\303\263 g\341\273\215i `GET /api/config` t\341\273\253 Backend \304\221\341\273\203 l\341\272\245y th\303\264ng tin.\n\n4. **AMR System Order API & Format Order ID**:\n   - AMR System nh\341\272\255n HTTP POST payload:\n     ```json\n     {\n       \"modelProcessCode\": \"cong_test_trigger\",\n       \"priority\": 6,\n       \"fromSystem\": \"Thadosoft\",\n       \"orderId\": \"cong_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_mmm\",\n       \"taskOrderDetail\": [\n         {\n           \"taskPath\": \"...\"\n         }\n       ]\n     }\n     ```\n   - Format `orderId` \304\221\303\243 ch\341\273\221t: `cong_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_mmm` (do Backend sinh, \304\221\341\272\243m b\341\272\243o duy nh\341\272\245t tuy\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\221i k\341\273\203 c\341\272\243 khi c\303\263 request \304\221\341\273\223ng th\341\273\235i t\341\273\253 nhi\341\273\201u PDA).\n\n5. **AMR System Trigger API**:\n   - HTTP POST payload:\n     ```json\n     {\n       \"currentStation\": \"...\"\n     }\n     ```\n\n6. **Giao di\341\273\207n & T\306\260\306\241ng t\303\241c (Mobile-First / PDA-First)**:\n   - T\341\273\221i \306\260u cho m\303\240n h\303\254nh c\341\272\243m \341\273\251ng nh\341\273\217 c\341\273\247a PDA: N\303\272t b\341\272\245m l\341\273\233n theo chi\341\273\201u d\341\273\215c, kho\341\272\243ng c\303\241ch an to\303\240n, h\341\272\241n ch\341\272\277 scroll, kh\303\264ng c\341\272\247n zoom, hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 r\303\265 r\303\240ng th\303\264ng tin Line & Station.\n   - Hai h\303\240nh \304\221\341\273\231ng ch\303\255nh: **[G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH]** v\303\240 **[TRIGGER]**.\n   - **B\341\272\257t bu\341\273\231c c\303\263 Confirmation Dialog** khi b\341\272\245m **[G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH]** (`[H\341\273\246Y]` / `[X\303\201C NH\341\272\254N]`), ch\341\273\211 g\341\273\255i request khi ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng b\341\272\245m `[X\303\201C NH\341\272\254N]`.\n\n7. **Line Locking (Shared State)**:\n   - State qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 theo **Line**: Khi Line A \304\221\303\243 \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c g\341\273\215i (tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i running/locked), n\303\272t **[G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH]** \341\273\237 c\341\272\243 A1 v\303\240 A2 b\341\273\213 **DISABLED**.\n   - Line B \304\221\341\273\231c l\341\272\255p, v\341\272\253n \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c ph\303\251p g\341\273\215i b\303\254nh th\306\260\341\273\235ng.\n   - Backend ch\341\273\213u tr\303\241ch nhi\341\273\207m qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 shared state n\303\240y v\303\240 validate request \304\221\341\273\203 ch\341\273\221ng duplicate call.\n\n8. **Ph\341\272\241m vi KH\303\224NG n\341\272\261m trong MVP**:\n   - Kh\303\264ng x\341\273\255 l\303\275 AMR completion t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng / t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng unlock n\303\272t (s\341\272\275 l\303\240m \341\273\237 phase sau).\n   - Kh\303\264ng t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng trigger theo v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 AMR.\n   - Kh\303\264ng c\303\263 giao di\341\273\207n dashboard hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 v\341\273\213 tr\303\255/pin/tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i chi ti\341\272\277t c\341\273\247a AMR.\n   - Kh\303\264ng l\303\240m \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng Android native (ch\341\273\211 ch\341\272\241y tr\303\252n tr\303\254nh duy\341\273\207t web c\341\273\247a PDA).\n   - Kh\303\264ng d\303\271ng Database ph\341\273\251c t\341\272\241p, Microservices, Redis, hay WebSocket n\341\272\277u ch\306\260a c\303\263 y\303\252u c\341\272\247u.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Danh s\303\241ch c\303\241c quy\341\272\277t \304\221\341\273\213nh c\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n (NEEDS DECISION)\n\nD\306\260\341\273\233i \304\221\303\242y l\303\240 5 quy\341\272\277t \304\221\341\273\213nh k\341\273\271 thu\341\272\255t v\303\240 ki\341\272\277n tr\303\272c quan tr\341\273\215ng c\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n xem x\303\251t v\303\240 ch\341\273\221t tr\306\260\341\273\233c khi tri\341\273\203n khai:\n\n---\n\n### Decision 1: C\303\241ch m\341\273\237 kh\303\263a (Unlock/Reset) n\303\272t G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH trong giai \304\221o\341\272\241n MVP\n\n#### V\341\272\245n \304\221\341\273\201:\nTheo \304\221\341\272\267c t\341\272\243, khi Line A \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c g\341\273\215i th\303\254 n\303\272t G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH c\341\273\247a Line A b\341\273\213 disable (kh\303\263a). V\303\254 t\303\255nh n\304\203ng **AMR Completion t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng ch\306\260a tri\341\273\203n khai trong MVP**, h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng c\341\272\247n c\303\263 c\306\241 ch\341\272\277 \304\221\341\273\203 \304\221\306\260a Line A tr\341\273\237 l\341\272\241i tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i IDLE (m\341\273\237 kh\303\263a) nh\341\272\261m ph\341\273\245c v\341\273\245 vi\341\273\207c test chu k\341\273\263 ti\341\272\277p theo ho\341\272\267c x\341\273\255 l\303\275 s\341\273\261 c\341\273\221.\n\n#### Option A (Khuy\341\272\277n ngh\341\273\213): N\303\272t \"M\341\273\237 kh\303\263a / Reset Line\" c\303\263 dialog x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Linh ho\341\272\241t, ng\306\260\341\273\235i v\341\272\255n h\303\240nh ho\341\272\267c tester t\341\272\241i station/qu\341\272\243n tr\341\273\213 vi\303\252n c\303\263 th\341\273\203 reset l\341\272\241i Line ngay tr\303\252n UI khi AMR ho\303\240n th\303\240nh l\306\260\341\273\243t ch\341\272\241y ngo\303\240i th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277 m\303\240 kh\303\264ng c\341\272\247n kh\341\273\237i \304\221\341\273\231ng l\341\272\241i server.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Th\303\252m 1 n\303\272t ph\341\273\245 tr\303\252n m\303\240n h\303\254nh (s\341\272\275 thi\341\272\277t k\341\272\277 nh\341\273\217 \341\273\237 g\303\263c d\306\260\341\273\233i ho\341\272\267c k\303\250m x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n \304\221\341\273\203 tr\303\241nh b\341\272\245m nh\341\272\247m).\n\n#### Option B: M\341\273\237 kh\303\263a t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng theo th\341\273\235i gian c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh (Timeout auto-unlock)\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: UI kh\303\264ng c\341\272\247n th\303\252m n\303\272t reset. Sau kho\341\272\243ng th\341\273\235i gian \304\221\341\273\213nh s\341\272\265n (v\303\255 d\341\273\245 60 gi\303\242y ho\341\272\267c c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c), Line t\341\273\261 chuy\341\273\203n v\341\273\201 IDLE.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Kh\303\264ng ph\341\272\243n \303\241nh \304\221\303\272ng th\341\273\235i gian ch\341\272\241y th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277 c\341\273\247a AMR; c\303\263 th\341\273\203 m\341\273\237 kh\303\263a qu\303\241 s\341\273\233m khi AMR ch\306\260a ch\341\272\241y xong.\n\n#### Option C: Ch\341\273\211 reset th\303\264ng qua API n\341\273\231i b\341\273\231 (v\303\255 d\341\273\245: `POST /api/line/reset`) ho\341\272\267c restart server\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: M\303\240n h\303\254nh PDA gi\341\273\257 nguy\303\252n t\341\273\221i gi\341\272\243n 100% \304\221\303\272ng 2 n\303\272t `[G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH]` v\303\240 `[TRIGGER]`.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: B\341\272\245t ti\341\273\207n cho ng\306\260\341\273\235i test t\341\272\241i station v\303\254 ph\341\272\243i g\341\273\215i curl/Postman \304\221\341\273\203 unlock.\n\n#### Recommendation:\nT\303\264i \304\221\341\273\201 xu\341\272\245t **Option A**, hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 m\341\273\231t n\303\272t nh\341\273\217 c\303\263 icon c\341\272\243nh b\303\241o \"Reset tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i Line\" (c\303\263 popup x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n) \341\273\237 cu\341\273\221i trang, v\341\273\253a \304\221\341\272\243m b\341\272\243o UI ch\303\255nh t\341\272\255p trung v\303\240o 2 n\303\272t b\341\272\245m l\341\273\233n, v\341\273\253a thu\341\272\255n ti\341\273\207n ki\341\273\203m th\341\273\255.\n\n#### C\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n:\nB\341\272\241n ch\341\273\215n **Option A**, **Option B** hay **Option C** (ho\341\272\267c b\341\272\241n c\303\263 quy t\341\272\257c unlock n\303\240o kh\303\241c cho MVP)?\n\n---\n\n### Decision 2: C\306\241 ch\341\272\277 \304\221\341\272\243m b\341\272\243o t\303\255nh Unique c\341\273\247a `orderId` khi nhi\341\273\201u PDA g\341\273\255i \304\221\341\273\223ng th\341\273\235i\n\n#### V\341\272\245n \304\221\341\273\201:\nFormat \304\221\303\243 ch\341\273\221t l\303\240 `cong_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_mmm`. N\341\272\277u 2 PDA t\341\272\241i 2 station g\341\273\255i request trong c\303\271ng 1 millisecond, timestamp c\303\263 th\341\273\203 tr\303\271ng nhau.\n\n#### Option A (Khuy\341\272\277n ngh\341\273\213): Mutex / In-Memory Lock + \304\220\341\272\243m b\341\272\243o b\306\260\341\273\233c nh\341\272\243y t\341\273\221i thi\341\273\203u 1ms\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Gi\341\273\257 \304\221\303\272ng 100% format chu\341\273\227i `cong_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_mmm` \304\221\303\243 ch\341\273\221t, kh\303\264ng th\303\252m b\341\272\245t k\341\273\263 k\303\275 t\341\273\261 n\303\240o ngo\303\240i \304\221\341\273\213nh d\341\272\241ng. X\341\273\255 l\303\275 tu\341\272\247n t\341\273\261 h\303\263a vi\341\273\207c sinh ID tr\303\252n Node.js backend. N\341\272\277u request \304\221\341\272\277n trong c\303\271ng 1 millisecond v\341\273\233i ID v\341\273\253a sinh, h\303\240m sinh ID s\341\272\275 c\341\273\231ng th\303\252m 1ms ho\341\272\267c \304\221\341\273\243i ms ti\341\272\277p theo.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: C\341\272\247n h\303\240m x\341\273\255 l\303\275 \304\221\341\273\223ng b\341\273\231 logic sinh timestamp \341\273\237 Backend.\n\n#### Option B: B\341\273\225 sung 2 s\341\273\221 ng\341\272\253u nhi\303\252n ho\341\272\267c s\341\273\221 th\341\273\251 t\341\273\261 \341\273\237 \304\221u\303\264i (v\303\255 d\341\273\245: `cong_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_mmm_01`)\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Tr\303\241nh tr\303\271ng l\341\272\267p d\341\273\205 d\303\240ng.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Thay \304\221\341\273\225i format \304\221\303\243 ch\341\273\221t trong t\303\240i li\341\273\207u (`cong_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_mmm`).\n\n#### Recommendation:\nT\303\264i \304\221\341\273\201 xu\341\272\245t **Option A** \304\221\341\273\203 gi\341\273\257 nguy\303\252n v\341\272\271n format b\341\272\241n \304\221\303\243 ch\341\273\221t, x\341\273\255 l\303\275 an to\303\240n b\341\272\261ng Mutex tu\341\272\247n t\341\273\261 h\303\263a \341\273\237 Backend.\n\n#### C\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n:\nB\341\272\241n \304\221\341\273\223ng \303\275 ch\341\273\215n **Option A** ch\341\273\251?\n\n---\n\n### Decision 3: C\306\241 ch\341\272\277 \304\221\341\273\223ng b\341\273\231 tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i kh\303\263a gi\341\273\257a c\303\241c PDA (Shared State Sync)\n\n#### V\341\272\245n \304\221\341\273\201:\nKhi PDA A1 b\341\272\245m G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH th\303\240nh c\303\264ng, Line A b\341\273\213 kh\303\263a. L\303\240m th\341\272\277 n\303\240o \304\221\341\273\203 PDA A2 (\304\221ang m\341\273\237 s\341\272\265n tr\303\254nh duy\341\273\207t t\341\272\241i station Dropoff) bi\341\272\277t Line A \304\221\303\243 b\341\273\213 kh\303\263a \304\221\341\273\203 disable n\303\272t G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH t\306\260\306\241ng \341\273\251ng?\n\n#### Option A (Khuy\341\272\277n ngh\341\273\213): HTTP Short Polling \304\221\341\273\213nh k\341\273\263 (m\341\273\227i 2 - 3 gi\303\242y)\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: \304\220\306\241n gi\341\272\243n, c\341\273\261c k\341\273\263 \341\273\225n \304\221\341\273\213nh tr\303\252n m\341\272\241ng c\303\264ng nghi\341\273\207p/WiFi ch\341\272\255p ch\341\273\235n c\341\273\247a PDA, tu\303\242n th\341\273\247 ti\303\252u ch\303\255 \"Kh\303\264ng over-engineer, ch\341\273\211 d\303\271ng HTTP REST\". N\341\272\277u m\341\272\245t k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i, polling t\341\273\261 ph\341\273\245c h\341\273\223i m\303\240 kh\303\264ng b\341\273\213 crash.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: T\341\272\241o ra request HTTP nh\341\272\271 m\341\273\227i 2-3s t\341\273\253 4 PDA (v\341\273\233i 4 thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213 th\303\254 t\341\272\243i server h\341\272\247u nh\306\260 b\341\272\261ng 0).\n\n#### Option B: Ch\341\273\211 c\341\272\255p nh\341\272\255t tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i khi m\341\273\237 trang ho\341\272\267c khi c\303\263 thao t\303\241c b\341\272\245m n\303\272t\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Kh\303\264ng sinh traffic n\341\273\201n.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: PDA A2 s\341\272\275 kh\303\264ng bi\341\272\277t n\303\272t \304\221\303\243 b\341\273\213 kh\303\263a cho \304\221\341\272\277n khi ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng b\341\272\245m v\303\240o v\303\240 nh\341\272\255n l\341\273\227i \"Line is currently locked\" t\341\273\253 Backend.\n\n#### Option C: Server-Sent Events (SSE)\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Real-time t\341\273\251c th\303\254, nh\341\272\271 h\306\241n WebSocket.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: C\341\272\247n qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i streaming HTTP tr\303\252n PDA Android browser.\n\n#### Recommendation:\nT\303\264i \304\221\341\273\201 xu\341\272\245t **Option A** (HTTP Short Polling m\341\273\227i 2-3s) v\303\254 t\303\255nh \341\273\225n \304\221\341\273\213nh cao, \304\221\303\272ng ti\303\252u ch\303\255 nh\341\273\217 g\341\273\215n, \304\221\306\241n gi\341\272\243n, kh\303\264ng over-engineer.\n\n#### C\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n:\nB\341\272\241n ch\341\273\215n **Option A**, **Option B** hay **Option C**?\n\n---\n\n### Decision 4: C\341\272\245u tr\303\272c Configuration File (`config.json`) v\303\240 Gi\303\241 tr\341\273\213 th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277\n\n#### V\341\272\245n \304\221\341\273\201:\nC\341\272\247n th\341\273\221ng nh\341\272\245t c\341\272\245u tr\303\272c file c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh tr\303\252n Backend \304\221\341\273\203 l\306\260u th\303\264ng tin Line, Station, Order Template v\303\240 Trigger Point.\n\nT\303\264i \304\221\341\273\201 xu\341\272\245t schema c\341\272\245u tr\303\272c nh\306\260 sau:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"amrSystem\": {\n    \"baseUrl\": \"http://192.168.1.100:8080\",\n    \"orderPath\": \"/api/order\",\n    \"triggerPath\": \"/api/trigger\",\n    \"timeoutMs\": 5000,\n    \"mockMode\": true\n  },\n  \"orderCommon\": {\n    \"modelProcessCode\": \"cong_test_trigger\",\n    \"priority\": 6,\n    \"fromSystem\": \"Thadosoft\"\n  },\n  \"lines\": {\n    \"line-a\": {\n      \"name\": \"Line A\",\n      \"taskPath\": \"10000007,10000008,10000006\",\n      \"stations\": {\n        \"pickup\": {\n          \"code\": \"A1\",\n          \"name\": \"Pickup\",\n          \"triggerStation\": \"10000007\"\n        },\n        \"dropoff\": {\n          \"code\": \"A2\",\n          \"name\": \"Dropoff\",\n          \"triggerStation\": \"10000008\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"line-b\": {\n      \"name\": \"Line B\",\n      \"taskPath\": \"20000007,20000008,20000006\",\n      \"stations\": {\n        \"pickup\": {\n          \"code\": \"B1\",\n          \"name\": \"Pickup\",\n          \"triggerStation\": \"20000007\"\n        },\n        \"dropoff\": {\n          \"code\": \"B2\",\n          \"name\": \"Dropoff\",\n          \"triggerStation\": \"20000008\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n*L\306\260u \303\275*: C\303\263 c\341\273\235 `\"mockMode\": true/false`:\n- Khi ch\341\272\241y trong m\303\264i tr\306\260\341\273\235ng ph\303\241t tri\341\273\203n / demo (ch\306\260a n\341\273\221i c\303\241p v\303\240o AMR RCS), Backend t\341\273\261 gi\341\272\243 l\341\272\255p ph\341\272\243n h\341\273\223i th\303\240nh c\303\264ng ho\341\272\267c m\303\243 l\341\273\227i m\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng \304\221\341\273\203 test tr\341\273\215n v\341\272\271n UI, lu\341\273\223ng lock, v\303\240 error handling.\n- Khi deploy v\303\240o x\306\260\341\273\237ng, ch\341\273\211 c\341\272\247n \304\221\341\273\225i `mockMode: false` v\303\240 \304\221i\341\273\201n `baseUrl` th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277 c\341\273\247a AMR System.\n\n#### C\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n:\n1. Schema c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh tr\303\252n c\303\263 ph\303\271 h\341\273\243p kh\303\264ng?\n2. \304\220i\341\273\203m `taskPath` v\303\240 `triggerStation` th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277 cho Line B c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n l\303\240 g\303\254 (ho\341\272\267c c\303\263 th\341\273\203 d\303\271ng t\341\272\241m gi\303\241 tr\341\273\213 m\341\272\253u nh\306\260 tr\303\252n)?\n3. B\341\272\241n c\303\263 \304\221\341\273\223ng \303\275 v\341\273\233i c\306\241 ch\341\272\277 `mockMode` \304\221\341\273\203 ph\341\273\245c v\341\273\245 test \304\221\341\273\231c l\341\272\255p tr\306\260\341\273\233c khi c\341\272\257m h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng th\341\272\255t kh\303\264ng?\n\n---\n\n### Decision 5: Thi\341\272\277t k\341\272\277 REST API gi\341\273\257a Frontend v\303\240 Small Backend\n\n#### V\341\272\245n \304\221\341\273\201:\nC\341\272\247n ch\341\273\221t danh s\303\241ch endpoint giao ti\341\272\277p gi\341\273\257a Frontend PDA v\303\240 Backend.\n\nT\303\264i \304\221\341\273\201 xu\341\272\245t danh s\303\241ch API nh\306\260 sau:\n\n| STT | Method | Endpoint | M\303\264 t\341\272\243 | Request Body / Query | Response m\341\272\253u |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `GET` | `/api/config?line=line-a&station=pickup` | L\341\272\245y config hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 cho Station t\306\260\306\241ng \341\273\251ng | Query: `line`, `station` | `{ success: true, data: { lineName: \"Line A\", stationName: \"Pickup\", lineKey: \"line-a\", stationKey: \"pickup\", taskPath: \"...\" } }` |\n| 2 | `GET` | `/api/state?line=line-a` | L\341\272\245y tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i kh\303\263a c\341\273\247a Line | Query: `line` | `{ success: true, data: { line: \"line-a\", status: \"idle\", currentOrderId: null } }` |\n| 3 | `POST` | `/api/order` | G\341\273\255i L\341\273\207nh g\341\273\215i AMR (sau khi \304\221\303\243 x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n tr\303\252n PDA) | `{ \"line\": \"line-a\", \"station\": \"pickup\" }` | `{ success: true, orderId: \"cong_...\", message: \"Order created successfully\" }` |\n| 4 | `POST` | `/api/trigger` | G\341\273\255i Trigger cho station | `{ \"line\": \"line-a\", \"station\": \"pickup\" }` | `{ success: true, stationTriggered: \"10000007\", message: \"Trigger sent successfully\" }` |\n| 5 | `POST` | `/api/line/reset` *(n\341\272\277u ch\341\273\215n Option A \341\273\237 Decision 1)* | M\341\273\237 kh\303\263a tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i Line th\341\273\247 c\303\264ng | `{ \"line\": \"line-a\" }` | `{ success: true, message: \"Line A reset to IDLE\" }` |\n\n- **X\341\273\255 l\303\275 l\341\273\227i (Error Contract)**:\n  N\341\272\277u th\341\272\245t b\341\272\241i (do AMR System tr\341\272\243 l\341\273\227i, timeout, ho\341\272\267c Line \304\221ang b\341\273\213 kh\303\263a), Backend tr\341\272\243 v\341\273\201:\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"success\": false,\n    \"errorCode\": \"LINE_LOCKED\" | \"AMR_UNAVAILABLE\" | \"AMR_REJECTED\" | \"INVALID_REQUEST\",\n    \"message\": \"Chi ti\341\272\277t l\341\273\227i th\303\242n thi\341\273\207n \304\221\341\273\203 hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 tr\303\252n m\303\240n h\303\254nh PDA\"\n  }\n  ```\n\n#### C\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n:\nB\341\272\241n c\303\263 \304\221\341\273\223ng \303\275 v\341\273\233i thi\341\272\277t k\341\272\277 API v\303\240 m\303\243 l\341\273\227i nh\306\260 tr\303\252n kh\303\264ng?\n\n---\n\nVui l\303\262ng xem qua v\303\240 cho t\303\264i \303\275 ki\341\272\277n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n \304\221\341\273\221i v\341\273\233i **5 Decision** tr\303\252n. Ngay sau khi b\341\272\241n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n, t\303\264i s\341\272\275 chuy\341\273\203n sang **Phase 2 & Phase 3** v\303\240 tri\341\273\203n khai theo \304\221\303\272ng chu\341\272\251n m\341\273\261c b\341\272\241n mong mu\341\273\221n!"
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Process**\n\nI\'ve been meticulously examining the user prompt instructions, specifically focusing on the workflow outlined. I\'m currently summarizing the requirements I understand and listing them as either \"CONFIRMED\" or \"NEEDS DECISION\" to ensure clarity. I\'m aiming to break down the process step-by-step to achieve the best outcome. I plan to use the \"32. C\303\201CH\" as inspiration for how to approach the task.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Requirements Clarity**\n\nI\'ve incorporated a system to handle uncertain decisions, using a structured format to present options, pros, cons, and my recommendation, seeking your validation before proceeding. I\'ve also solidified my adherence to the core principles: requirement correctness, simplicity, implementability, maintainability, and scalability. This approach helps in avoiding unnecessary complexities. Currently, the thought process is heavily focused on Requirement Confirmation, delaying all coding until approval.\n\n\n**Defining the Architecture**\n\nI\'ve clarified the system\'s architecture based on the given requirements, which are now all CONFIRMED. My focus is now the interactions between the components: Frontend, Backend, and the AMR System. I\'m focusing on the data flow for order creation and trigger events, making sure that everything is synchronized correctly. I\'m moving toward drafting the initial API design. I need to make sure the Line Locking is properly addressed in the architecture.\n\n\n**Addressing Line Locking**\n\nI\'m currently focused on how to handle line locking, especially given the MVP scope limitations. Specifically, I\'m considering how to reset or unlock lines (A and B) manually, since AMR completion is out of scope. I need to figure out if we should incorporate a manual reset button, a dev reset endpoint, or if we need an auto mechanism to change line status back to \'idle\'. Line A gets disabled when it is called/running, and I need to figure out how to re-enable Line A, when AMR Completion is not available. I also need your input on how to best handle shared state management in this context.\n\n\n**Evaluating Reset Options**\n\nMy current focus is on line reset mechanisms. I\'m torn between manual operator intervention (a reset button or API endpoint) versus an automated timeout-based unlock. Another approach involves in-memory storage, necessitating a backend restart for reset. I need to balance operator ease of use with system autonomy. I\'m leaning toward Option A, providing an override, but want to make sure the tradeoff with the other options is weighed.\n\n**Refining Configuration Schema**\n\nI\'m now structuring the backend configuration file schema, especially concerning task paths, current station values, and AMR system endpoints. I\'m focusing on clarifying whether the config should be flat or hierarchical to best handle all the potential configurations. Considering whether an explicit line reset is required, or a timeout is needed. I\'m assessing the best defaults for taskPath values and currentStationn, given the different AMRs in the mock environment versus the real world.\n\n\n**Deciding Data Structure**\n\nI\'m now determining the structure for storing order and station data, evaluating two primary options. I need to figure out the pros and cons of merging `orders.json` and `stations.json` into one file versus keeping them separate, focusing on clarity and ease of management. I\'m also considering how this affects data retrieval and potential updates.\n\n\n\n**Implementing Polling**\n\nI\'m now weighing the best method for real-time updates on line lock status between PDAs. Option A, short polling every few seconds, seems most straightforward. Option B, only fetching on page load or action, is less reactive, while Option C, Server-Sent Events, provides real-time updates but increases complexity. I am evaluating how to best structure the configuration for different connection scenarios, focusing on clear environmental variable options, and avoiding hardcoding.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "Ch\303\240o b\341\272\241n, t\303\264i \304\221\303\243 nh\341\272\255n to\303\240n b\341\273\231 b\341\272\243n \304\221\341\272\267c t\341\272\243 y\303\252u c\341\272\247u v\303\240 n\341\272\257m r\303\265 **Nguy\303\252n t\341\272\257c l\303\240m vi\341\273\207c quan tr\341\273\215ng nh\341\272\245t: TUY\341\273\206T \304\220\341\273\220I KH\303\224NG T\341\273\260 \303\235 QUY\341\272\276T \304\220\341\273\212NH** v\341\273\201 architecture, tech stack, data model, API design, hay b\341\272\245t k\341\273\263 behavior n\303\240o khi ch\306\260a c\303\263 s\341\273\261 x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n.\n\nTu\303\242n th\341\273\247 \304\221\303\272ng quy tr\303\254nh, t\303\264i **ch\306\260a vi\341\272\277t b\341\272\245t k\341\273\263 d\303\262ng code nghi\341\273\207p v\341\273\245 n\303\240o** v\303\240 b\341\272\257t \304\221\341\272\247u ngay b\341\272\261ng **Phase 1 \342\200\224 Requirement Confirmation**.\n\n---\n\n# PHASE 1 \342\200\224 REQUIREMENT CONFIRMATION\n\n## 1. Danh s\303\241ch y\303\252u c\341\272\247u \304\221\303\243 x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n (CONFIRMED)\n\n1. **Ph\341\272\241m vi h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng**:\n   - \304\220i\341\273\201u khi\341\273\203n **1 AMR duy nh\341\272\245t**.\n   - C\303\263 2 Line/Cycle: **Line A** v\303\240 **Line B**.\n   - M\341\273\227i Line c\303\263 2 station: **Pickup** v\303\240 **Dropoff** (T\341\273\225ng c\341\273\231ng 4 station: A1, A2, B1, B2).\n   - Thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213: PDA Android m\303\240n h\303\254nh nh\341\273\217, truy c\341\272\255p qua Android Browser.\n\n2. **\304\220\341\273\213nh tuy\341\272\277n URL c\341\273\247a 4 Station**:\n   - `/control/line-a/pickup`\n   - `/control/line-a/dropoff`\n   - `/control/line-b/pickup`\n   - `/control/line-b/dropoff`\n   - URL ch\341\273\211 d\303\271ng \304\221\341\273\203 x\303\241c \304\221\341\273\213nh `line` v\303\240 `station`. Frontend kh\303\264ng hardcode d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u nghi\341\273\207p v\341\273\245.\n\n3. **C\341\272\245u h\303\254nh Order & Trigger**:\n   - Hai station trong c\303\271ng m\341\273\231t Line d\303\271ng chung 1 L\341\273\207nh g\341\273\215i AMR (A1 & A2 d\303\271ng chung **L\341\273\207nh A**; B1 & B2 d\303\271ng chung **L\341\273\207nh B**).\n   - L\341\273\207nh A v\303\240 L\341\273\207nh B ch\341\273\211 kh\303\241c nhau \341\273\237 `orderId` v\303\240 `taskPath`.\n   - M\341\273\227i station c\303\263 m\341\273\231t \304\221i\341\273\203m Trigger ri\303\252ng bi\341\273\207t (`currentStation`).\n   - Frontend \304\221\341\273\215c `line` v\303\240 `station` t\341\273\253 URL, sau \304\221\303\263 g\341\273\215i `GET /api/config` t\341\273\253 Backend \304\221\341\273\203 l\341\272\245y th\303\264ng tin.\n\n4. **AMR System Order API & Format Order ID**:\n   - AMR System nh\341\272\255n HTTP POST payload:\n     ```json\n     {\n       \"modelProcessCode\": \"cong_test_trigger\",\n       \"priority\": 6,\n       \"fromSystem\": \"Thadosoft\",\n       \"orderId\": \"cong_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_mmm\",\n       \"taskOrderDetail\": [\n         {\n           \"taskPath\": \"...\"\n         }\n       ]\n     }\n     ```\n   - Format `orderId` \304\221\303\243 ch\341\273\221t: `cong_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_mmm` (do Backend sinh, \304\221\341\272\243m b\341\272\243o duy nh\341\272\245t tuy\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\221i k\341\273\203 c\341\272\243 khi c\303\263 request \304\221\341\273\223ng th\341\273\235i t\341\273\253 nhi\341\273\201u PDA).\n\n5. **AMR System Trigger API**:\n   - HTTP POST payload:\n     ```json\n     {\n       \"currentStation\": \"...\"\n     }\n     ```\n\n6. **Giao di\341\273\207n & T\306\260\306\241ng t\303\241c (Mobile-First / PDA-First)**:\n   - T\341\273\221i \306\260u cho m\303\240n h\303\254nh c\341\272\243m \341\273\251ng nh\341\273\217 c\341\273\247a PDA: N\303\272t b\341\272\245m l\341\273\233n theo chi\341\273\201u d\341\273\215c, kho\341\272\243ng c\303\241ch an to\303\240n, h\341\272\241n ch\341\272\277 scroll, kh\303\264ng c\341\272\247n zoom, hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 r\303\265 r\303\240ng th\303\264ng tin Line & Station.\n   - Hai h\303\240nh \304\221\341\273\231ng ch\303\255nh: **[G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH]** v\303\240 **[TRIGGER]**.\n   - **B\341\272\257t bu\341\273\231c c\303\263 Confirmation Dialog** khi b\341\272\245m **[G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH]** (`[H\341\273\246Y]` / `[X\303\201C NH\341\272\254N]`), ch\341\273\211 g\341\273\255i request khi ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng b\341\272\245m `[X\303\201C NH\341\272\254N]`.\n\n7. **Line Locking (Shared State)**:\n   - State qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 theo **Line**: Khi Line A \304\221\303\243 \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c g\341\273\215i (tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i running/locked), n\303\272t **[G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH]** \341\273\237 c\341\272\243 A1 v\303\240 A2 b\341\273\213 **DISABLED**.\n   - Line B \304\221\341\273\231c l\341\272\255p, v\341\272\253n \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c ph\303\251p g\341\273\215i b\303\254nh th\306\260\341\273\235ng.\n   - Backend ch\341\273\213u tr\303\241ch nhi\341\273\207m qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 shared state n\303\240y v\303\240 validate request \304\221\341\273\203 ch\341\273\221ng duplicate call.\n\n8. **Ph\341\272\241m vi KH\303\224NG n\341\272\261m trong MVP**:\n   - Kh\303\264ng x\341\273\255 l\303\275 AMR completion t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng / t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng unlock n\303\272t (s\341\272\275 l\303\240m \341\273\237 phase sau).\n   - Kh\303\264ng t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng trigger theo v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 AMR.\n   - Kh\303\264ng c\303\263 giao di\341\273\207n dashboard hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 v\341\273\213 tr\303\255/pin/tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i chi ti\341\272\277t c\341\273\247a AMR.\n   - Kh\303\264ng l\303\240m \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng Android native (ch\341\273\211 ch\341\272\241y tr\303\252n tr\303\254nh duy\341\273\207t web c\341\273\247a PDA).\n   - Kh\303\264ng d\303\271ng Database ph\341\273\251c t\341\272\241p, Microservices, Redis, hay WebSocket n\341\272\277u ch\306\260a c\303\263 y\303\252u c\341\272\247u.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Danh s\303\241ch c\303\241c quy\341\272\277t \304\221\341\273\213nh c\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n (NEEDS DECISION)\n\nD\306\260\341\273\233i \304\221\303\242y l\303\240 5 quy\341\272\277t \304\221\341\273\213nh k\341\273\271 thu\341\272\255t v\303\240 ki\341\272\277n tr\303\272c quan tr\341\273\215ng c\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n xem x\303\251t v\303\240 ch\341\273\221t tr\306\260\341\273\233c khi tri\341\273\203n khai:\n\n---\n\n### Decision 1: C\303\241ch m\341\273\237 kh\303\263a (Unlock/Reset) n\303\272t G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH trong giai \304\221o\341\272\241n MVP\n\n#### V\341\272\245n \304\221\341\273\201:\nTheo \304\221\341\272\267c t\341\272\243, khi Line A \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c g\341\273\215i th\303\254 n\303\272t G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH c\341\273\247a Line A b\341\273\213 disable (kh\303\263a). V\303\254 t\303\255nh n\304\203ng **AMR Completion t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng ch\306\260a tri\341\273\203n khai trong MVP**, h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng c\341\272\247n c\303\263 c\306\241 ch\341\272\277 \304\221\341\273\203 \304\221\306\260a Line A tr\341\273\237 l\341\272\241i tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i IDLE (m\341\273\237 kh\303\263a) nh\341\272\261m ph\341\273\245c v\341\273\245 vi\341\273\207c test chu k\341\273\263 ti\341\272\277p theo ho\341\272\267c x\341\273\255 l\303\275 s\341\273\261 c\341\273\221.\n\n#### Option A (Khuy\341\272\277n ngh\341\273\213): N\303\272t \"M\341\273\237 kh\303\263a / Reset Line\" c\303\263 dialog x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Linh ho\341\272\241t, ng\306\260\341\273\235i v\341\272\255n h\303\240nh ho\341\272\267c tester t\341\272\241i station/qu\341\272\243n tr\341\273\213 vi\303\252n c\303\263 th\341\273\203 reset l\341\272\241i Line ngay tr\303\252n UI khi AMR ho\303\240n th\303\240nh l\306\260\341\273\243t ch\341\272\241y ngo\303\240i th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277 m\303\240 kh\303\264ng c\341\272\247n kh\341\273\237i \304\221\341\273\231ng l\341\272\241i server.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Th\303\252m 1 n\303\272t ph\341\273\245 tr\303\252n m\303\240n h\303\254nh (s\341\272\275 thi\341\272\277t k\341\272\277 nh\341\273\217 \341\273\237 g\303\263c d\306\260\341\273\233i ho\341\272\267c k\303\250m x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n \304\221\341\273\203 tr\303\241nh b\341\272\245m nh\341\272\247m).\n\n#### Option B: M\341\273\237 kh\303\263a t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng theo th\341\273\235i gian c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh (Timeout auto-unlock)\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: UI kh\303\264ng c\341\272\247n th\303\252m n\303\272t reset. Sau kho\341\272\243ng th\341\273\235i gian \304\221\341\273\213nh s\341\272\265n (v\303\255 d\341\273\245 60 gi\303\242y ho\341\272\267c c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c), Line t\341\273\261 chuy\341\273\203n v\341\273\201 IDLE.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Kh\303\264ng ph\341\272\243n \303\241nh \304\221\303\272ng th\341\273\235i gian ch\341\272\241y th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277 c\341\273\247a AMR; c\303\263 th\341\273\203 m\341\273\237 kh\303\263a qu\303\241 s\341\273\233m khi AMR ch\306\260a ch\341\272\241y xong.\n\n#### Option C: Ch\341\273\211 reset th\303\264ng qua API n\341\273\231i b\341\273\231 (v\303\255 d\341\273\245: `POST /api/line/reset`) ho\341\272\267c restart server\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: M\303\240n h\303\254nh PDA gi\341\273\257 nguy\303\252n t\341\273\221i gi\341\272\243n 100% \304\221\303\272ng 2 n\303\272t `[G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH]` v\303\240 `[TRIGGER]`.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: B\341\272\245t ti\341\273\207n cho ng\306\260\341\273\235i test t\341\272\241i station v\303\254 ph\341\272\243i g\341\273\215i curl/Postman \304\221\341\273\203 unlock.\n\n#### Recommendation:\nT\303\264i \304\221\341\273\201 xu\341\272\245t **Option A**, hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 m\341\273\231t n\303\272t nh\341\273\217 c\303\263 icon c\341\272\243nh b\303\241o \"Reset tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i Line\" (c\303\263 popup x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n) \341\273\237 cu\341\273\221i trang, v\341\273\253a \304\221\341\272\243m b\341\272\243o UI ch\303\255nh t\341\272\255p trung v\303\240o 2 n\303\272t b\341\272\245m l\341\273\233n, v\341\273\253a thu\341\272\255n ti\341\273\207n ki\341\273\203m th\341\273\255.\n\n#### C\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n:\nB\341\272\241n ch\341\273\215n **Option A**, **Option B** hay **Option C** (ho\341\272\267c b\341\272\241n c\303\263 quy t\341\272\257c unlock n\303\240o kh\303\241c cho MVP)?\n\n---\n\n### Decision 2: C\306\241 ch\341\272\277 \304\221\341\272\243m b\341\272\243o t\303\255nh Unique c\341\273\247a `orderId` khi nhi\341\273\201u PDA g\341\273\255i \304\221\341\273\223ng th\341\273\235i\n\n#### V\341\272\245n \304\221\341\273\201:\nFormat \304\221\303\243 ch\341\273\221t l\303\240 `cong_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_mmm`. N\341\272\277u 2 PDA t\341\272\241i 2 station g\341\273\255i request trong c\303\271ng 1 millisecond, timestamp c\303\263 th\341\273\203 tr\303\271ng nhau.\n\n#### Option A (Khuy\341\272\277n ngh\341\273\213): Mutex / In-Memory Lock + \304\220\341\272\243m b\341\272\243o b\306\260\341\273\233c nh\341\272\243y t\341\273\221i thi\341\273\203u 1ms\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Gi\341\273\257 \304\221\303\272ng 100% format chu\341\273\227i `cong_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_mmm` \304\221\303\243 ch\341\273\221t, kh\303\264ng th\303\252m b\341\272\245t k\341\273\263 k\303\275 t\341\273\261 n\303\240o ngo\303\240i \304\221\341\273\213nh d\341\272\241ng. X\341\273\255 l\303\275 tu\341\272\247n t\341\273\261 h\303\263a vi\341\273\207c sinh ID tr\303\252n Node.js backend. N\341\272\277u request \304\221\341\272\277n trong c\303\271ng 1 millisecond v\341\273\233i ID v\341\273\253a sinh, h\303\240m sinh ID s\341\272\275 c\341\273\231ng th\303\252m 1ms ho\341\272\267c \304\221\341\273\243i ms ti\341\272\277p theo.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: C\341\272\247n h\303\240m x\341\273\255 l\303\275 \304\221\341\273\223ng b\341\273\231 logic sinh timestamp \341\273\237 Backend.\n\n#### Option B: B\341\273\225 sung 2 s\341\273\221 ng\341\272\253u nhi\303\252n ho\341\272\267c s\341\273\221 th\341\273\251 t\341\273\261 \341\273\237 \304\221u\303\264i (v\303\255 d\341\273\245: `cong_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_mmm_01`)\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Tr\303\241nh tr\303\271ng l\341\272\267p d\341\273\205 d\303\240ng.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Thay \304\221\341\273\225i format \304\221\303\243 ch\341\273\221t trong t\303\240i li\341\273\207u (`cong_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_mmm`).\n\n#### Recommendation:\nT\303\264i \304\221\341\273\201 xu\341\272\245t **Option A** \304\221\341\273\203 gi\341\273\257 nguy\303\252n v\341\272\271n format b\341\272\241n \304\221\303\243 ch\341\273\221t, x\341\273\255 l\303\275 an to\303\240n b\341\272\261ng Mutex tu\341\272\247n t\341\273\261 h\303\263a \341\273\237 Backend.\n\n#### C\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n:\nB\341\272\241n \304\221\341\273\223ng \303\275 ch\341\273\215n **Option A** ch\341\273\251?\n\n---\n\n### Decision 3: C\306\241 ch\341\272\277 \304\221\341\273\223ng b\341\273\231 tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i kh\303\263a gi\341\273\257a c\303\241c PDA (Shared State Sync)\n\n#### V\341\272\245n \304\221\341\273\201:\nKhi PDA A1 b\341\272\245m G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH th\303\240nh c\303\264ng, Line A b\341\273\213 kh\303\263a. L\303\240m th\341\272\277 n\303\240o \304\221\341\273\203 PDA A2 (\304\221ang m\341\273\237 s\341\272\265n tr\303\254nh duy\341\273\207t t\341\272\241i station Dropoff) bi\341\272\277t Line A \304\221\303\243 b\341\273\213 kh\303\263a \304\221\341\273\203 disable n\303\272t G\341\273\214I L\341\273\206NH t\306\260\306\241ng \341\273\251ng?\n\n#### Option A (Khuy\341\272\277n ngh\341\273\213): HTTP Short Polling \304\221\341\273\213nh k\341\273\263 (m\341\273\227i 2 - 3 gi\303\242y)\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: \304\220\306\241n gi\341\272\243n, c\341\273\261c k\341\273\263 \341\273\225n \304\221\341\273\213nh tr\303\252n m\341\272\241ng c\303\264ng nghi\341\273\207p/WiFi ch\341\272\255p ch\341\273\235n c\341\273\247a PDA, tu\303\242n th\341\273\247 ti\303\252u ch\303\255 \"Kh\303\264ng over-engineer, ch\341\273\211 d\303\271ng HTTP REST\". N\341\272\277u m\341\272\245t k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i, polling t\341\273\261 ph\341\273\245c h\341\273\223i m\303\240 kh\303\264ng b\341\273\213 crash.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: T\341\272\241o ra request HTTP nh\341\272\271 m\341\273\227i 2-3s t\341\273\253 4 PDA (v\341\273\233i 4 thi\341\272\277t b\341\273\213 th\303\254 t\341\272\243i server h\341\272\247u nh\306\260 b\341\272\261ng 0).\n\n#### Option B: Ch\341\273\211 c\341\272\255p nh\341\272\255t tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i khi m\341\273\237 trang ho\341\272\267c khi c\303\263 thao t\303\241c b\341\272\245m n\303\272t\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Kh\303\264ng sinh traffic n\341\273\201n.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: PDA A2 s\341\272\275 kh\303\264ng bi\341\272\277t n\303\272t \304\221\303\243 b\341\273\213 kh\303\263a cho \304\221\341\272\277n khi ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng b\341\272\245m v\303\240o v\303\240 nh\341\272\255n l\341\273\227i \"Line is currently locked\" t\341\273\253 Backend.\n\n#### Option C: Server-Sent Events (SSE)\n- **\306\257u \304\221i\341\273\203m**: Real-time t\341\273\251c th\303\254, nh\341\272\271 h\306\241n WebSocket.\n- **Nh\306\260\341\273\243c \304\221i\341\273\203m**: C\341\272\247n qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i streaming HTTP tr\303\252n PDA Android browser.\n\n#### Recommendation:\nT\303\264i \304\221\341\273\201 xu\341\272\245t **Option A** (HTTP Short Polling m\341\273\227i 2-3s) v\303\254 t\303\255nh \341\273\225n \304\221\341\273\213nh cao, \304\221\303\272ng ti\303\252u ch\303\255 nh\341\273\217 g\341\273\215n, \304\221\306\241n gi\341\272\243n, kh\303\264ng over-engineer.\n\n#### C\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n:\nB\341\272\241n ch\341\273\215n **Option A**, **Option B** hay **Option C**?\n\n---\n\n### Decision 4: C\341\272\245u tr\303\272c Configuration File (`config.json`) v\303\240 Gi\303\241 tr\341\273\213 th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277\n\n#### V\341\272\245n \304\221\341\273\201:\nC\341\272\247n th\341\273\221ng nh\341\272\245t c\341\272\245u tr\303\272c file c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh tr\303\252n Backend \304\221\341\273\203 l\306\260u th\303\264ng tin Line, Station, Order Template v\303\240 Trigger Point.\n\nT\303\264i \304\221\341\273\201 xu\341\272\245t schema c\341\272\245u tr\303\272c nh\306\260 sau:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"amrSystem\": {\n    \"baseUrl\": \"http://192.168.1.100:8080\",\n    \"orderPath\": \"/api/order\",\n    \"triggerPath\": \"/api/trigger\",\n    \"timeoutMs\": 5000,\n    \"mockMode\": true\n  },\n  \"orderCommon\": {\n    \"modelProcessCode\": \"cong_test_trigger\",\n    \"priority\": 6,\n    \"fromSystem\": \"Thadosoft\"\n  },\n  \"lines\": {\n    \"line-a\": {\n      \"name\": \"Line A\",\n      \"taskPath\": \"10000007,10000008,10000006\",\n      \"stations\": {\n        \"pickup\": {\n          \"code\": \"A1\",\n          \"name\": \"Pickup\",\n          \"triggerStation\": \"10000007\"\n        },\n        \"dropoff\": {\n          \"code\": \"A2\",\n          \"name\": \"Dropoff\",\n          \"triggerStation\": \"10000008\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"line-b\": {\n      \"name\": \"Line B\",\n      \"taskPath\": \"20000007,20000008,20000006\",\n      \"stations\": {\n        \"pickup\": {\n          \"code\": \"B1\",\n          \"name\": \"Pickup\",\n          \"triggerStation\": \"20000007\"\n        },\n        \"dropoff\": {\n          \"code\": \"B2\",\n          \"name\": \"Dropoff\",\n          \"triggerStation\": \"20000008\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n*L\306\260u \303\275*: C\303\263 c\341\273\235 `\"mockMode\": true/false`:\n- Khi ch\341\272\241y trong m\303\264i tr\306\260\341\273\235ng ph\303\241t tri\341\273\203n / demo (ch\306\260a n\341\273\221i c\303\241p v\303\240o AMR RCS), Backend t\341\273\261 gi\341\272\243 l\341\272\255p ph\341\272\243n h\341\273\223i th\303\240nh c\303\264ng ho\341\272\267c m\303\243 l\341\273\227i m\303\264 ph\341\273\217ng \304\221\341\273\203 test tr\341\273\215n v\341\272\271n UI, lu\341\273\223ng lock, v\303\240 error handling.\n- Khi deploy v\303\240o x\306\260\341\273\237ng, ch\341\273\211 c\341\272\247n \304\221\341\273\225i `mockMode: false` v\303\240 \304\221i\341\273\201n `baseUrl` th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277 c\341\273\247a AMR System.\n\n#### C\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n:\n1. Schema c\341\272\245u h\303\254nh tr\303\252n c\303\263 ph\303\271 h\341\273\243p kh\303\264ng?\n2. \304\220i\341\273\203m `taskPath` v\303\240 `triggerStation` th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277 cho Line B c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n l\303\240 g\303\254 (ho\341\272\267c c\303\263 th\341\273\203 d\303\271ng t\341\272\241m gi\303\241 tr\341\273\213 m\341\272\253u nh\306\260 tr\303\252n)?\n3. B\341\272\241n c\303\263 \304\221\341\273\223ng \303\275 v\341\273\233i c\306\241 ch\341\272\277 `mockMode` \304\221\341\273\203 ph\341\273\245c v\341\273\245 test \304\221\341\273\231c l\341\272\255p tr\306\260\341\273\233c khi c\341\272\257m h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng th\341\272\255t kh\303\264ng?\n\n---\n\n### Decision 5: Thi\341\272\277t k\341\272\277 REST API gi\341\273\257a Frontend v\303\240 Small Backend\n\n#### V\341\272\245n \304\221\341\273\201:\nC\341\272\247n ch\341\273\221t danh s\303\241ch endpoint giao ti\341\272\277p gi\341\273\257a Frontend PDA v\303\240 Backend.\n\nT\303\264i \304\221\341\273\201 xu\341\272\245t danh s\303\241ch API nh\306\260 sau:\n\n| STT | Method | Endpoint | M\303\264 t\341\272\243 | Request Body / Query | Response m\341\272\253u |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `GET` | `/api/config?line=line-a&station=pickup` | L\341\272\245y config hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 cho Station t\306\260\306\241ng \341\273\251ng | Query: `line`, `station` | `{ success: true, data: { lineName: \"Line A\", stationName: \"Pickup\", lineKey: \"line-a\", stationKey: \"pickup\", taskPath: \"...\" } }` |\n| 2 | `GET` | `/api/state?line=line-a` | L\341\272\245y tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i kh\303\263a c\341\273\247a Line | Query: `line` | `{ success: true, data: { line: \"line-a\", status: \"idle\", currentOrderId: null } }` |\n| 3 | `POST` | `/api/order` | G\341\273\255i L\341\273\207nh g\341\273\215i AMR (sau khi \304\221\303\243 x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n tr\303\252n PDA) | `{ \"line\": \"line-a\", \"station\": \"pickup\" }` | `{ success: true, orderId: \"cong_...\", message: \"Order created successfully\" }` |\n| 4 | `POST` | `/api/trigger` | G\341\273\255i Trigger cho station | `{ \"line\": \"line-a\", \"station\": \"pickup\" }` | `{ success: true, stationTriggered: \"10000007\", message: \"Trigger sent successfully\" }` |\n| 5 | `POST` | `/api/line/reset` *(n\341\272\277u ch\341\273\215n Option A \341\273\237 Decision 1)* | M\341\273\237 kh\303\263a tr\341\272\241ng th\303\241i Line th\341\273\247 c\303\264ng | `{ \"line\": \"line-a\" }` | `{ success: true, message: \"Line A reset to IDLE\" }` |\n\n- **X\341\273\255 l\303\275 l\341\273\227i (Error Contract)**:\n  N\341\272\277u th\341\272\245t b\341\272\241i (do AMR System tr\341\272\243 l\341\273\227i, timeout, ho\341\272\267c Line \304\221ang b\341\273\213 kh\303\263a), Backend tr\341\272\243 v\341\273\201:\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"success\": false,\n    \"errorCode\": \"LINE_LOCKED\" | \"AMR_UNAVAILABLE\" | \"AMR_REJECTED\" | \"INVALID_REQUEST\",\n    \"message\": \"Chi ti\341\272\277t l\341\273\227i th\303\242n thi\341\273\207n \304\221\341\273\203 hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 tr\303\252n m\303\240n h\303\254nh PDA\"\n  }\n  ```\n\n#### C\341\272\247n b\341\272\241n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n:\nB\341\272\241n c\303\263 \304\221\341\273\223ng \303\275 v\341\273\233i thi\341\272\277t k\341\272\277 API v\303\240 m\303\243 l\341\273\227i nh\306\260 tr\303\252n kh\303\264ng?\n\n---\n\nVui l\303\262ng xem qua v\303\240 cho t\303\264i \303\275 ki\341\272\277n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n \304\221\341\273\221i v\341\273\233i **5 Decision** tr\303\252n. Ngay sau khi b\341\272\241n x\303\241c nh\341\272\255n, t\303\264i s\341\272\275 chuy\341\273\203n sang **Phase 2 & Phase 3** v\303\240 tri\341\273\203n khai theo \304\221\303\272ng chu\341\272\251n m\341\273\261c b\341\272\241n mong mu\341\273\221n!"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 7
      nanos: 88101
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
