  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Server State**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the `server/state.ts` module. My thought process is centered around the unique `orderId` generator. I\'m aiming for a format like `cong_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_mmm` and need the backend to ensure its uniqueness, even with concurrent requests. I\'m investigating the best approach to guarantee this ID generation.\n\n\n**Refining Order ID Generation**\n\nI\'ve refined the `orderId` generation strategy to ensure absolute uniqueness. The approach leverages `lastGeneratedTimestampMs`, incrementing it if a collision occurs. This guarantees sequential uniqueness and maintains the `cong_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_mmm` format. I\'ve also defined a date formatting helper. I am also working on line locking and state management, to avoid collisions when multiple PDAs are interacting with the server.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 431548561
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
